This contract provides DVLA employees with a range of managed employee benefits, including:

- An Employee Benefits Platform and app;
- Employee Discounts and cashback;
- A Reward and Recognition scheme;
- A Cycle to Work Scheme (available as a Salary Sacrifice);
- Discounted Gym Memberships;
- A Childcare Voucher Scheme (available as a Salary Sacrifice);
- A Payroll Giving Scheme;

This contract was awarded following a mini-competition under Crown Commercial Services Employee Benefits and Services Framework agreement RM6273. It has an initial term of 3 years, from 01 October 2025 to
